{"unit_id":"LIU20030725__dsh-skill-manager#feature-1","repo":"LIU20030725/dsh-skill-manager","commit":"85eff1958360a6b718628b47b2f7db490fd41f4e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skill-manager 的功能「分类与标签」：为技能 frontmatter 设置分类和多个标签，也可清除已有值。通过设置面板或 /skillmgr set-category、/skillmgr set-tags 命令操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:94-120","lib/index.js:232-251","lib/client.js:244-252"]}
