{"unit_id":"LIU20030725__dsh-skill-manager#feature-3","repo":"LIU20030725/dsh-skill-manager","commit":"85eff1958360a6b718628b47b2f7db490fd41f4e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skill-manager 的功能「技能浏览与启停」：设置面板列出技能并展示说明、分类、标签和调用状态；用户可切换模型调用开关，插件将变更写回技能文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:125-149","lib/index.js:253-261","lib/client.js:205-253"]}
